Turn a raw image into an Android sparse image

Usage: android-doctor sparse [OPTIONS] --output <OUTPUT> <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  Raw image to convert

Options:
      --no-color                 Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>          
      --block-size <BLOCK_SIZE>  Block size in bytes, a multiple of 4 [default: 4096]
      --force                    Replace an existing output file instead of refusing
  -h, --help                     Print help
